senses.gloss:
r. 1st cl. (ईक्षते)
To see. It most usually occurs compounded with one or other of the prepositions, as
with अप,
to expect;
with अभि,
to gaze at;
with अव,
to inspect;
with उत् or उप,
to expect or await;
with उप,
to abandon;
with निर्,
to see; []
with परि,
to try, to test, to assay;
with प्र,
to see, to resemble, or look like;
with वि,
to inspect;
with प्रति,
1 to look for, to expect.
2 to venerate;
with सम,
to compare, to contrast, to select;
with प्रति and उत्,
to look up at.
